.env.conductor

# Encrypted .env files (.env, .env.local, .env.production, .env.example)
# ARE safe to commit — dotenvx encrypts values at rest. Don't add a
# blanket .env*.local rule here; we want .env.local committed so the
# whole team picks up the same dev secrets after a clone.
